<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-LAT FIXING FOR SOFT CURRENCIES MARCH 24-30.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-LAT FIXING FOR SOFT CURRENCIES MARCH 24-30.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank set the following</p>
<p>fixings for the lat for soft currencies, valid for the period</p>
<p>March 24 to March 30.</p>
<p>    Belarus rouble 1000	   0.0240</p>
<p>    Kazakh tenge 1000	     7.63</p>
<p>    Azerbaijan manat 1000	 0.141</p>
<p>    Uzbek sum			 0.0099</p>
<p>    Georgian lari		   0.458</p>
<p>    Armenian dinar 1000	   1.39</p>
<p>    Turkmen manat 1000	    0.140</p>
<p>    Tadzik 1000		     1.482</p>
<p>    Ukraine grivna		  0.314</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
